1
00:01:31,740 --> 00:01:35,020
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,430 --> 00:01:37,660
[Episode 25]

3
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,610
She should be the one to call first.

4
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:45,479
It doesn't matter
if I acknowledge her as my daughter.

5
00:01:45,479 --> 00:01:48,740
What matters is
whether she acknowledges me as her mother.

6
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,120
Aren't you always the one to cave first?

7
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,850
What did you say?

8
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:06,870
I mean,

9
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,009
we need to give Qi Shi some time.

10
00:02:30,590 --> 00:02:37,540
[Prime Era]

11
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:41,030
Since its founding, Xinran Women's Wear

12
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,590
has registered every single design

13
00:02:42,590 --> 00:02:44,420
for copyright

14
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,560
at the Copyright Protection Center.

15
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:49,079
We welcome oversight
from all sectors of society.

16
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:51,630
We hereby issue a warning

17
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:53,430
to certain stores in the market:

18
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:55,030
plagiarism may enjoy fleeting popularity,

19
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:56,380
but originality is the
fundamental cornerstone

20
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:58,380
of a company's long-term survival.

21
00:02:58,880 --> 00:02:59,960
This statement is obviously

22
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,120
aimed right at us.

23
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:05,430
Nowadays, people all like going online.

24
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,080
When they put that out on the internet,

25
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:08,750
it directly ruins

26
00:03:08,750 --> 00:03:10,150
our store's reputation.

27
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,280
No wonder.

28
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,430
Our return rate has already hit

29
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,360
over 90%.

30
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:18,030
And we still have so much inventory.

31
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:19,030
What should we do?

32
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:21,240
Don't panic, everyone.

33
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,690
We need to stay calm at a time like this.

34
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,120
A high return rate

35
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,220
just shows that

36
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,680
consumers have high standards

37
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,940
for original designs.

38
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,030
It's not entirely a bad thing

39
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:30,960
for us.

40
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:36,470
Let's reassure the customers first.

41
00:03:36,470 --> 00:03:38,590
As long as it meets the platform's rules,

42
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:40,920
returns are processed unconditionally.

43
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,450
I'm going to Xinran now.

44
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,700
No matter what,

45
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,150
we cannot let these dirty tricks

46
00:03:48,150 --> 00:03:49,680
destroy the original brand

47
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,750
we've worked so hard

48
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:51,280
to build.

49
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,240
Qi... No,

50
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,400
Ms. Qi.

51
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,170
When it comes to design,

52
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,710
inspiration comes from everywhere.

53
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:16,040
There are plenty of similar styles

54
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,839
in the market.

55
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,700
You claim we plagiarized.

56
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,240
Do you have any proof?

57
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,560
On the other hand,

58
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:24,950
your company poached

59
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:26,510
Zeng Yuanyuan
from our design department recently.

60
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:29,240
The moment she left,
our company secrets leaked.

61
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:30,290
Don't you think

62
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,210
that's a bit too coincidental?

63
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,490
You really know how to twist the truth.

64
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,600
Zeng Yuanyuan resigned properly.

65
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,630
She joined us

66
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,730
for better career opportunities.

67
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,390
Besides, all my designs

68
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,270
are original.

69
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,430
I have hand‑drawn drafts

70
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:44,600
for every single detail.

71
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,060
Don't even try to smear me.

72
00:04:47,190 --> 00:04:48,590
Hand‑drawn drafts, huh?

73
00:04:48,850 --> 00:04:49,720
Who knows

74
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:51,070
if you copied them?

75
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:54,810
Fine.

76
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,520
I'll take legal action.

77
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,890
I will make you pay for this.

78
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:01,950
Go ahead and sue me.

79
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,390
Do it as soon as possible.

80
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,070
I'd like to see

81
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,270
what kind of waves

82
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:07,670
you can actually stir up.

83
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,300
I won't see you out.

84
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:41,760
Hello?

85
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,170
What did Xinran say?

86
00:05:44,950 --> 00:05:46,080
What could they say?

87
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,000
Denying it to death.

88
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:52,250
Plagiarism claims are hard to win

89
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,000
without solid evidence.

90
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,080
How about I go to the factory?

91
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,040
Dayunfa manufactures clothes

92
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,300
for both us and Xinran.

93
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,560
Maybe Director Liu

94
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,750
can testify for us.

95
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:04,830
Then I'll go with you.

96
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:05,200
Okay.

97
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:20,040
Who is it?

98
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:22,770
The weather forecast.

99
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,850
It's getting colder day by day.

100
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,070
Qi Shi's warehouse

101
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:35,130
is drafty all over.

102
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,860
It must be pretty cold.

103
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,800
Why don't you send her a text

104
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,600
to remind her?

105
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:52,510
She's a grown woman.

106
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:53,430
Can't she check

107
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:55,159
the weather forecast herself?

108
00:06:55,810 --> 00:06:57,670
Does she not know when she's cold?

109
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,510
Qi Shi isn't married yet.

110
00:06:59,510 --> 00:07:01,910
She still needs her parents
to care for her.

111
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,090
If you won't send it, I will.

112
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,190
What are you doing?

113
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,150
Don't spoil her.

114
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,380
Just finish your meal.

115
00:07:22,390 --> 00:07:24,860
[Recipient: Qi Shi. Haizhou Weather]

116
00:07:28,950 --> 00:07:29,750
This Director Liu

117
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,480
keeps beating around the bush.

118
00:07:32,130 --> 00:07:32,970
I don't think

119
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,400
he wants to help us at all.

120
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,820
He's just a fence-sitter.

121
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,560
Such a big factory

122
00:07:38,810 --> 00:07:40,800
must have receipts
for orders and shipments.

123
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,530
With the dates on the receipts,

124
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,600
it's crystal clear who copied whom.

125
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,800
He just doesn't want to offend Xinran

126
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:48,400
or get involved in this mess.

127
00:07:49,430 --> 00:07:51,380
We're really in a tough spot this time,

128
00:07:51,380 --> 00:07:53,510
suffering in silence
with no way to voice our grievances.

129
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:55,170
Fine, I've learned my lesson.

130
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,310
From now on,

131
00:07:57,190 --> 00:07:58,159
every new design

132
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,040
will be registered

133
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,800
for copyright immediately.

134
00:08:01,870 --> 00:08:02,480
Exactly.

135
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:04,390
And when we attend trade shows

136
00:08:04,390 --> 00:08:05,510
or launch new collections,

137
00:08:05,510 --> 00:08:07,160
we need to archive all related materials.

138
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:09,560
They can serve as evidence
when it matters.

139
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,720
Also,
about that Garment Industry Association

140
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,950
he mentioned,

141
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:15,310
I'll look into it when I get back.

142
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,160
Either way,

143
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,920
it's better than fighting alone.

144
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,940
Haizhou Weather.

145
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,580
Temperatures will drop sharply tomorrow.

146
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:21,920
Low of 5 degrees Celsius.

147
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,250
North wind, force 4 to 5.

148
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,830
Please dress warmly

149
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,120
to avoid colds.

150
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:27,510
Take precautions against wind
when heading out.

151
00:08:27,510 --> 00:08:29,170
I'm hungry. Let's grab something to eat.

152
00:08:29,170 --> 00:08:30,900
We still have a battle to fight.

153
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:37,760
Dad, something came up at the company.

154
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,120
Qi Shi and I will be quite busy lately.

155
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,909
Don't wait up for me

156
00:08:40,909 --> 00:08:42,169
for dinner these days.

157
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,670
Pick up something to eat downstairs
if you'd like.

158
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:46,470
Call me if there's an emergency.

159
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:40,020
[Prime Era]

160
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,330
How are things on your end?

161
00:10:44,630 --> 00:10:47,240
I've noticed Qi Shi
looking terrible lately,

162
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:48,670
barely eating anything.

163
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,020
This hit has really

164
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:53,440
taken a toll on Qi Shi.

165
00:10:54,670 --> 00:10:56,240
Returns have been piling up

166
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,400
these past few days,

167
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,360
and our working capital

168
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:02,970
is almost completely drained.

169
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:03,910
Cash‑flow issues?

170
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:04,970
Is it that serious?

171
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:09,060
Is there anything I can do to help?

172
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:10,970
Just stay home,

173
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,240
take good care of your parents,

174
00:11:12,240 --> 00:11:13,320
and be there for them—

175
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:15,720
that's more important than anything else.

176
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,790
As her brother,

177
00:11:21,730 --> 00:11:22,360
when it really counts,

178
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,360
I can't do a thing.

179
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,280
In our family,

180
00:11:26,670 --> 00:11:27,870
when it comes to guts,

181
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:29,120
Qi Shi's second to none.

182
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,520
No one dares claim first.

183
00:11:30,550 --> 00:11:31,210
Look at her,

184
00:11:31,510 --> 00:11:32,870
she starts a company

185
00:11:33,030 --> 00:11:34,890
and builds a brand just like that.

186
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,440
I've always believed

187
00:11:36,790 --> 00:11:38,190
nothing could stump her.

188
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,910
But after all,

189
00:11:42,390 --> 00:11:43,440
she's only human.

190
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,490
An ordinary person.

191
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,120
Everyone has times

192
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,650
when they get knocked down.

193
00:12:02,630 --> 00:12:04,430
Good thing Xin is there with her.

194
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:07,870
Our younger siblings

195
00:12:07,870 --> 00:12:09,330
are far braver than we are.

196
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,970
Are you still there?

197
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:33,240
Cao Si,

198
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,600
we only live once.

199
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:37,490
I don't want to leave any regrets.

200
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,320
No matter what difficulties

201
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,780
we will face in the future,

202
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,700
for the rest of my life,

203
00:12:42,870 --> 00:12:44,670
I just want to take good care
of you and Doudou,

204
00:12:44,670 --> 00:12:46,030
and give you a warm home.

205
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:48,470
Are you willing to

206
00:12:50,210 --> 00:12:52,090
build a new family with me?

207
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:03,090
You're proposing to me over the phone?

208
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:05,150
Could you be any less formal?

209
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,480
W-Well, we were just talking about them,

210
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,670
and it just came up.

211
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:08,270
Qi Zhi,

212
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:12,000
dating is between two people.

213
00:13:13,750 --> 00:13:14,270
But marriage

214
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:15,670
is between two families.

215
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,270
I don't want you to be caught

216
00:13:19,270 --> 00:13:20,910
between your parents and me.

217
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:22,920
I understand.

218
00:13:23,910 --> 00:13:24,360
Cao Si,

219
00:13:25,270 --> 00:13:26,270
give me some time.

220
00:13:26,790 --> 00:13:29,050
I'm confident I can convince my parents.

221
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,780
Don't work too late, you guys.

222
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:32,590
Get some rest.

223
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:33,600
I'm hanging up.

224
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,630
This boy

225
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,030
is a real man.

226
00:13:37,550 --> 00:13:38,350
He's got guts.

227
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,840
He takes after me in that.

228
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,530
Let's go sleep.

229
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,270
Honey,

230
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,630
I think

231
00:14:05,370 --> 00:14:06,760
Qi Zhi is serious

232
00:14:06,790 --> 00:14:08,390
about getting back together

233
00:14:08,670 --> 00:14:09,870
with Cao Si this time.

234
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:13,000
Haven't you noticed how much more mature

235
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,360
he acts these days?

236
00:14:26,910 --> 00:14:28,000
Now both families

237
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:29,300
have cleared the air.

238
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,400
Let me put it this way.

239
00:14:32,770 --> 00:14:33,840
Cao Si is a good kid

240
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:35,870
from a family we know inside and out.

241
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:36,790
How about

242
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,810
we just let him go for it?

243
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:52,610
Qi Shi hasn't replied to the text yet?

244
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:55,110
No phone call either?

245
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:08,720
Sure, her company's

246
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,630
going through a major crisis

247
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:13,320
and she's working around the clock,

248
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:15,360
but is it really so hard
to shoot a quick call

249
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:16,320
or a text?

250
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,510
Seriously.

251
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:25,640
I guess our girl

252
00:15:25,670 --> 00:15:27,470
hasn't been eating well lately.

253
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:28,870
How about we

254
00:15:29,630 --> 00:15:31,290
bring her some buns tomorrow?

255
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:38,810
Let's sleep.

256
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:56,540
♪ The wind blew through our hair ♪

257
00:15:59,230 --> 00:16:02,910
♪ The story slowly gets complicated too ♪

258
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:10,900
♪ We never became anyone's myth ♪

259
00:16:11,830 --> 00:16:16,910
♪ We only learned to grow up in the rain ♪

260
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,030
What are you doing?

261
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:16,480
Stop!

262
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:17,750
If I catch you,

263
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:18,690
I'll teach you a lesson,

264
00:16:18,690 --> 00:16:19,290
I swear.

265
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:23,160
♪ Should we blame fate? ♪

266
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,150
Keep your voice down.
The kids will hear you.

267
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:23,750
Why don't you just tear it up?

268
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:27,000
Once you start school,
this will come in handy.

269
00:16:25,650 --> 00:16:29,700
♪ Adulthood is bandaging your own falls ♪

270
00:16:27,510 --> 00:16:28,480
I will definitely find a way

271
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,680
to cure your illness,

272
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:31,530
so you can go to school happily

273
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,360
like other kids.

274
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:35,360
♪ Rented rooms, the last bus home ♪

275
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:34,630
I know my own daughter

276
00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:35,440
very well.

277
00:16:35,380 --> 00:16:37,610
♪ What does the future hold? ♪

278
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:38,240
She doesn't cause trouble,
but she's definitely not afraid of it.

279
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:42,900
♪ It's been long since I last had
the guts to say I feared ♪

280
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:38,870
Right, right.

281
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,870
I can figure it out

282
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:40,910
with my eyes closed.

283
00:16:40,910 --> 00:16:41,790
These brats

284
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,360
bullied my daughter first.

285
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,420
Say sorry to Qi Shi.

286
00:16:46,380 --> 00:16:49,770
♪ Though we have nothing,
we still bustle about ♪

287
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:47,720
Zhi.

288
00:16:48,390 --> 00:16:49,390
Did you run all the way back

289
